  "description": "Built for exploration and everyday utility. The Mondial Adventure is designed for riders who want a rugged, versatile bike that can handle commuting, weekend trips, or loaded touring. With durable steel construction, wide 27.5” tires, and optional front racks, it’s ready for whatever your ride demands.\nBUILT TO LAST\nDurable Mondial steel frame and fork designed for strength, reliability, and long-term use.\n\nCARRY IT ALL\n\nOptional Memento Atlas or Fourmi front racks let you bring gear, groceries, or camping supplies without hassle.\nNO PROPRIETARY PARTS\nStandard components throughout. Easy to service, replace, or upgrade anywhere.\nRELIABLE COMPONENTS\nShimano CUES U6000 2x10 drivetrain and UR300 brakes deliver dependable shifting and stopping power.\n\nTOUGH WHEELS & TIRES\n\nHand-built wheels paired with wide 27.5x2.25” tires provide traction, comfort, and confidence off-road.\nDESIGNED IN-HOUSE\nEvery Mondial Adventure is thoughtfully designed and assembled by us from start to finish.\nNO GIMMICKS\nA rugged, versatile bike that does exactly what it’s built for: exploring, commuting, and adventuring.",
